# Fixed 2026-10-09, defect 513, lane b16-compiler (class improvement).
# Symptom: constructing each case of an N-case variant cost the checker the
# square of N, 0.56, 1.52 and 4.78 billion instructions at 400, 800 and
# 1,600 cases, and the lowering the same, 1.24, 3.39 and 10.9 billion.
# Cause: `check/walk.hero`'s `case_construct` and `ir/layout.hero`'s
# `case_index` each walked the variant's case names at every construction.
# Each reads a table of the variant's names now, made the first time one
# of its cases is asked for.
# This case: each of 400 cases built, and beside them a case with fields
# built from the table's index and a name the variant does not have.
